 "name": "SVG Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2019-02-13",
 "description": "<p>The mission of this group is to gather and incubate new features and requirements for SVG — making it easier for software developers and content creators in the SVG community to engage with the SVG standardization process.</p>\r\n<p>This group will complement the SVG working group, and covers the same scope of technologies. Draft proposals for new SVG features, developed in the community group, may transition to recommendation-track specifications in the working group.</p>\r\n<p>This group may publish specifications.</p>\r\n<p>See the <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://svg-cg.github.io/charter/\">SVG CG charter</a> for more information.</p>\r\n\r\n",
